39-
40-    Input structure
41-    The grid has a black background, one solid rectangular legend made of
42-    adjacent vertical color bars, and one or more placed instances of the same
43-    sprite mask in colors from that legend.
44-
45-    Rule
46-    Read the legend colors from left to right.  These colors fill consecutive
47-    vertical sprite slots from top to bottom.  The existing sprite instances
48-    provide the common mask, left edge, and vertical anchor of the stack; missing
49-    legend colors are inserted into their corresponding slots.
50-
51-    Key insight
52-    Existing sprites are already in the same rank positions named by the legend,
53-    so any one of them fixes the whole ordered stack geometry.
54-    """
55-    g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)
